  description: "One morning after a storm, a guard in Coal Cauldron\u2019s gang saw
    a speck in the sky and woke up the whole camp. Crash Belt was not dead. He was
    back and could now ride the wind, gather electrical power like the ancient gods,
    and also give it to his allies."
